                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote2" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 2"><sup>2</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>The Richmond Fed’s estimates of the size of the safety net are available <a href="/research/national_economy/bailout_barometer">online</a>.</p></div>
                </div>
